    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "可控标准型中系统矩阵的特殊结构被称为上友伴型，因为特征方程为 a(s) = s^n + a1 s^{n-1} + a2 s^{n-2} + ... + an，且该首一“友伴”多项式的系数就是 A_c 第一行中的元素。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The special structure of the system matrix in control canonical form is referred to as the upper companion form because the characteristic equation is a(s) = s^n + a1 s^{n-1} + a2 s^{n-2} + ... + an and the coefficients of this monic 'companion' polynomial are the elements in the first row of A_c.",
